<title>POLAND: Kompap plans to pay 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Kompap plans to pay 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish paper firm Kompap SA said its general shareholders' meeting on April 26 will decide on the management's proposal to pay a 1996 dividend, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Kompap gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
